  "next_id": 66,
  "comments": "Mirror Transport Museum. Modest Mussorgsky, Pictures at an Exhibition, Promenade I. Quarter note = 40 throughout. Two beats of low bowed B-flat introduce the clarinet. The same player sings all 24 bars in a lower register. Soft sustained bows and occasional piano chords support the line. Legato tracks share the corresponding soft clarinet recordings. Expand a folder to edit the notes and phrase expression. Bounce the Loop end marker with render_promenade.py.\nPiano score from Mutopia-2004/07/20-475 (public domain). Clarinet and bowed cellos from Versilian Studios Chamber Orchestra 2 Community Edition (CC0), https://github.com/sgossner/VSCO-2-CE/tree/440300901dfe9275fd84e0b7763af1f8443ae62e . Grand piano from Salamander Grand Piano v3 by Alexander Holm, soft v4 recordings, https://github.com/sfzinstruments/SalamanderGrandPiano/tree/3382bf9496bba2486f5ab0de55a264d1dfc38404 , CC BY 3.0 https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/ .",
  "midi_originals": {}
